# Build outputs of compiling examples/*.maxon in place. Only the .maxon sources are
# tracked: the executable, the debug-info sidecar every build writes alongside it, the
# coverage counts a `maxon coverage` run leaves behind, and the per-directory build
# cache are all regenerated by a build. Mirrors maxon-sharp/DebugSamples/.gitignore.
/.maxon/
*.exe
*.mxdbg
*.mxcov
